{"3876490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Wings Required", "steam_appid": 3876490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/9c178fdbf37078444bfcba250e521ade.poster.avif?t=1786545533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/9c178fdbf37078444bfcba250e521ade.webm?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/9c178fdbf37078444bfcba250e521ade.mp4?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/e104fe292e2cd352a68cba8e2f4e22c1.poster.avif?t=1786545533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/e104fe292e2cd352a68cba8e2f4e22c1.webm?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/e104fe292e2cd352a68cba8e2f4e22c1.mp4?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/18b2d6188c724115cef9419a12c17336.poster.avif?t=1786545533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/18b2d6188c724115cef9419a12c17336.webm?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/18b2d6188c724115cef9419a12c17336.mp4?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What you can expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 – 5 hours of relaxed exploration, with plenty of replayable mini-games to enjoy along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloons, lots of them. Some are hidden, others are not, but they're everywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters with over-the-top personalities. Some are mean, some are nice, and some are just… interesting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming music. We worked with the incredibly talented folks at Fablefly Music to create a soundtrack that is both playful and curious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill collectathon with no rush and no stress. Wander around, discover things, and play however fast (or slow) you feel like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that feels nostalgic, inspired by the games we grew up with and that familiar urge to revisit them years later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sincere game about flying around, having fun, and embracing what makes you… you. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/9c178fdbf37078444bfcba250e521ade.poster.avif?t=1786545533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/9c178fdbf37078444bfcba250e521ade.webm?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/9c178fdbf37078444bfcba250e521ade.mp4?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/e104fe292e2cd352a68cba8e2f4e22c1.poster.avif?t=1786545533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/e104fe292e2cd352a68cba8e2f4e22c1.webm?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/e104fe292e2cd352a68cba8e2f4e22c1.mp4?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/18b2d6188c724115cef9419a12c17336.poster.avif?t=1786545533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/18b2d6188c724115cef9419a12c17336.webm?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/extras/18b2d6188c724115cef9419a12c17336.mp4?t=1786545533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What you can expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 – 5 hours of relaxed exploration, with plenty of replayable mini-games to enjoy along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloons, lots of them. Some are hidden, others are not, but they're everywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters with over-the-top personalities. Some are mean, some are nice, and some are just… interesting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming music. We worked with the incredibly talented folks at Fablefly Music to create a soundtrack that is both playful and curious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill collectathon with no rush and no stress. Wander around, discover things, and play however fast (or slow) you feel like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that feels nostalgic, inspired by the games we grew up with and that familiar urge to revisit them years later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sincere game about flying around, having fun, and embracing what makes you… you. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Start your first day at work as an unqualified duck with a balloon and way too much confidence. Wander the Featherfall Islands, help quirky locals, and learn that “winging it” might actually be a real career strategy.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/3bcb4982ee2fd38a0dbff9e7c541966a00d12948/header.jpg?t=1786545533", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/38570f011f5c36afe54f26398f8da3da96a09dc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786545533", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876490/38570f011f5c36afe54f26398f8da3da96a09dc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786545533", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 740 | Radeon HD 5770<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Apple GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Zuko Studios"], "publishers": ["Zuko Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 4666260, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows"